# Development only: `make up` loads `.env` from this checkout, and nothing else
# reads it — luu itself never reads a .env, since a project's own would then
# decide what luu may reach. Copy this to `.env` and fill it in.

# The working directory: the root luu works under, from which a session's
# project folder is picked. Without it, it is where luu was started — here,
# luu's own source. Relative to this checkout. The same as `--workdir`.
# LUU_WORKDIR=../my-project
